{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-04-25T17:57:34.780Z","sessionId":"7d0c3af5-e839-4afc-975f-a7aa736c1b80","content":"## Task\nImplement Sprint 1: Smoke Test Artifact\n\n## Branch\nCreate and switch to branch: `ai/sprint-1-smoke-test-artifact`\nRun: `git checkout -b ai/sprint-1-smoke-test-artifact` (or `git checkout ai/sprint-1-smoke-test-artifact` if it already exists from a retry)\n\n## Sprint Specification\n{\n  \"sprint_number\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"Smoke Test Artifact\",\n  \"goal\": \"Produce the HELLO.md file requested by the test spec to confirm the pipeline works end-to-end.\",\n  \"features\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"s1-f1\",\n      \"name\": \"Create HELLO.md greeting file\",\n      \"description\": \"As a tester validating the system, I want a file named HELLO.md to appear at the project root containing the word 'hello' so that I can confirm the planner-to-executor pipeline can read a request from docs/TEST.md and produce the requested artifact.\",\n      \"acceptance_criteria\": [\n        \"A file named HELLO.md exists at the repository root\",\n        \"The file contains the text 'hello' (case as specified by the test request)\",\n        \"The file is plain Markdown and contains no extraneous boilerplate, frontmatter, or unrelated content\",\n        \"No existing project files are modified or deleted as a side effect\"\n      ],\n      \"touches\": [\n        \"repository root file\"\n      ],\n      \"risk_notes\": \"Trivial risk; ensure the filename casing matches HELLO.md exactly and that no pre-existing HELLO.md is overwritten with unrelated content.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"success_criteria\": [\n    \"HELLO.md is present at the project root with the greeting content\",\n    \"The original docs/TEST.md request is satisfied verbatim\",\n    \"No regressions to any other files in the repository\"\n  ]\n}\n\n## Full Spec Constraints\n[\n  \"Scope is strictly limited to the single instruction found in docs/TEST.md\",\n  \"No new features, dependencies, or infrastructure should be introduced\",\n  \"Avoid creating additional documentation files beyond the requested HELLO.md\"\n]\n\n## Out of Scope\n[\n  \"Any test framework setup, CI configuration, or automated test harnesses\",\n  \"Refactoring or modifications to existing project code or docs\",\n  \"Additional greeting variants, localization, or templating\",\n  \"Updating CLAUDE.md or other project documentation\"\n]\n\n## Instructions\n1. Read CLAUDE.md and key source files to understand current patterns\n2. Create the branch\n3. Implement each feature in the order listed\n4. Commit after each feature with format: [ai-builder/generator] description\\nSprint: 1 | Feature: <id>\n5. After ALL features are implemented, output the sprint contract as a ```json block\n\nSet run_id to \"20260425-195708\" in the contract.\nSet branch to \"ai/sprint-1-smoke-test-artifact\" in the contract."}
